<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA 155 FOR TWO AT TEA ON OPENING DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 155 FOR TWO AT TEA ON OPENING DAY.</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 155 for two at tea on the opening day of the third and final cricket test against South Africa on Sunday.</p>
<p>Openers Nayan Mongia for 41 and Woorkeri Raman for 57 were the batsmen out.</p>
<p>At tea, Saurav Ganguly was batting on 39 and Sachin Tendulkar was on 13.</p>
